  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">START-SEI will conduct a scoping study to assess current education and training capabilities in target African and Asian countries and to determine what additional investments in education, training, and communication are needed in the context of &quot;best practices&quot; for adaptation and climate risk management in institutional and policy landscape of each country.</narrative>
